+ECC: separation of agents, skills, hooks, rules, memory and security mechanisms.
+
+External systems provide comparative evidence, not automatic design instructions.
+
+D — WISDOM INFERENCE
+
+Architectural interpretations derived from A, B and C.
+
+These must be explicitly identified as inference and must not be reported as repository facts.
